        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Posterize to Four Bits\n\nReduces the number of tones per color channel so the image falls into flat bands. Use it for a screenprint look or to preview banding.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Image\" input goes to \"Posterize\", which keeps 4 bits per channel, or sixteen levels. \"Result\" shows the banded image. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set bits on \"Posterize\" to 2 for heavier banding, or to 1 for a stark two-tone result."
        },
